{"4725170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elven Huntress: Sunveil", "steam_appid": 4725170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4750680, 4750670], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elven Huntress: Sunveil is an atmospheric third-person 3D action RPG with exploration, loot, crafting, and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an elven huntress, explore fantasy locations through magical portals, battle orcs, humans, and the undead, find rare equipment, and restore the ancient fortress of Sunveil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.poster.avif?t=1787744452\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.webm?t=1787744452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.mp4?t=1787744452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a fantasy world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the portal to a variety of locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow-covered mountain ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coniferous forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark lands of the undead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, gather resources, unlock new equipment, and improve your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own elven huntress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the character creator, customize your appearance, and collect unique sets of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Sunveil Fortress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunveil is your main hub and progression center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between raids, upgrade your fortress and unlock new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and armor crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy and potion making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment transmogrification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item enhancement with runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elven Huntress: Sunveil is an atmospheric single-player adventure with a beautiful protagonist, enjoyable progression, and a world you'll want to return to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elven Huntress: Sunveil is an atmospheric third-person 3D action RPG with exploration, loot, crafting, and character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as an elven huntress, explore fantasy locations through magical portals, battle orcs, humans, and the undead, find rare equipment, and restore the ancient fortress of Sunveil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.poster.avif?t=1787744452\" width=1170 height=558 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.webm?t=1787744452\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4725170/extras/a8b8bca7025f593a8f3be10a16b28734.mp4?t=1787744452\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a fantasy world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the portal to a variety of locations:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow-covered mountain ruins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coniferous forests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient fortresses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark lands of the undead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies, gather resources, unlock new equipment, and improve your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own elven huntress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the character creator, customize your appearance, and collect unique sets of equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Sunveil Fortress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunveil is your main hub and progression center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between raids, upgrade your fortress and unlock new features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapon and armor crafting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alchemy and potion making.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment transmogrification.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item enhancement with runes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character progression system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elven Huntress: Sunveil is an atmospheric single-player adventure with a beautiful protagonist, enjoyable progression, and a world you'll want to return to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>"